{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b92e0b8337e6d60b","name":"Voice-Print Command Lock","source":{"id":"source:reference-b92e0b8337e6d60b","title":"Voice-Print Command Lock","revision":21129,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:12:50Z","sha256":"324a969f0f1e0202cafc4983dbc216102437cfcae7b3ad9f9fc26dabfc76ef36","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21129","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Voice-Print%20Command%20Lock&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b92e0b8337e6d60b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 400\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1 Kilogram\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Accessory"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Accessory"}," ensures that a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," is able to obey only its master. With a Voice-Print Command Lock installed, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," follows only commands issued by a single source. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," analyses the voice print of its master and ignores commands from anyone else. A recording of the master's voice can be used, but getting the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," to obey a recorded command requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check against the Droid's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," with a +5 bonus to the Droid's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
